WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:10.990
Please don't expect too much from it.
This story is a simple illustration of the three
Minami sisters and the ordinary life they lead.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:17.330
Five, six, seven, eight, nine...

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.500
Hosaka, Hosaka!

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:23.290
Hawk's claw peppers
should be ripped into the pan.

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:26.960
Stir-fry for a little longer.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.890
What is it, Hayami?

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.860
How long are you going to keep cooking?

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.060
What a foolish question.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:36.590
A man must eat for as long as he lives.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.330
I will stop cooking...

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.640
when I die!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.810
Death!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.700
That hurt.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.020
That's not what I meant.

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:50.220
Don't you think you should try to appeal to Haruka-chan from a different angle?

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:51.690
From a different angle?

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:53.200
Yep.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.660
For example... that.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:01:02.120
Ten, eleven, twelve, thirteen,
...fourteen, fifteen, seventeen...

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.040
Huh? Sixteen...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.320
Knitting?

00:01:04.320 --> 00:01:05.490
Yeah!

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:08.920
It would be perfect
.for these chilly months.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:12.010
If you start now, you might just
.make it in time for Christmas.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:13.800
I see.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.090
By the way, based on this year's trends and my personal preference...

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.680
I recommend something like this!

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.950
Let's give it a try, Hosaka!

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:28.610
If you can finish it
...before the winter break...

00:01:28.610 --> 00:01:29.590
I refuse.

00:01:29.590 --> 00:01:30.270
Huh?

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:35.280
I started cooking for Minami Haruka, and my skills have indeed improved.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:39.490
However, I have yet to make her smile.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.740
You haven't even talked to her yet...

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.260
No matter what I do
.with these untrained hands,

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.910
they will always be empty.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.850
When I make Minami Haruka smile,

00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.920
only then shall I start knitting.

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:58.390
For her, her daughters, and
.our happy family together.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.840
I heard Haruka-chan say she likes knitting.

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:02.760
What's that?

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:06.150
Then starting today, I like knitting too.

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.070
Thirty-one...

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.200
Um...

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:13.960
Don't mind me. Keep going.

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.720
O-Okay...

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:25.150
Thirty-two, thirty-three, thirty-four,
...thirty-five, thirty-six, thirty-seven...

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:29.090
"The most important thing when
.knitting is to keep your cool.

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.630
If you rush, you may stitch it the wrong way,

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:35.340
and if you pull the yarn too tightly, the stitches will get too tight.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.090
You should take periodic breaks and stretch.

00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:39.670
Take your time while knitting.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.430
Above all, you must enjoy it.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.600
That is the key to completing your work."

00:02:45.870 --> 00:02:47.890
It seems you have an extra stitch there.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:54.620
I see.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.700
You must pull each stitch to the same tightness, or the widths of the rows will vary.

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.490
There's more to knitting than I thought.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.690
Fifty-five, fifty-six, fifty-seven,
...fifty-eight, fifty-nine, sixty...

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:08.960
Looks like this year's Christmas is going to be fun.

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:42.970
The Goddess Descends on the Holy Night

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.440
Morning!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:49.140
Huh?

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:53.100
Maki's wearing a new coat.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.480
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:57.980
It's okay. I just got here.

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.110
Let's get going.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:00.020
Yeah!

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:06.360
Man, I knew it was getting cold, but it's <i>really</i> cold today.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.780
Yeah. It's seriously cold.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.660
Is your scarf as warm and fluffy as it looks?

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:17.920
Yeah, it's pretty warm. I really like it.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.880
Your coat looks pretty warm too.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.420
Oh, you noticed?

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.130
It's a new one.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:28.890
I couldn't help but buy it.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:32.600
Well?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.180
How is it?

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.730
It looks good on you.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.650
The intent behind Maki's questions is always plain as day.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:45.460
I'm glad you always know what I want to hear.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:48.840
Oh, really?

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:50.030
Yep.

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:53.300
Atsuko!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.370
Hayami-senpai.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.580
What's up?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.460
Well, there's something I just can't make up my mind about.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.250
That's unusual for you.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.590
Can I ask you something, Atsuko?

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.350
Okay...

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.010
Huh? What about me?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:11.100
Hot cocoa that's too light on flavor
.or coffee with too much cream.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:12.560
Which is better?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.100
Um... What are you...

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.560
Which do you think is better?

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:23.710
Hot cocoa or coffee?

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.570
Maybe she can't make up her mind about which one to get?

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.490
But that doesn't seem like the case here.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.160
Then could it be an analogy for something?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.580
Hot cocoa that's too light on flavor
...and coffee with too much cream...

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:36.610
You can add more flavor to the cocoa by putting more in,

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:39.260
but I guess you can just
add more coffee as well?

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.760
But then you might need to add some more hot water and sugar too.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:46.220
And if you add too much, it might be difficult to bring it back to perfection.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.510
I think hot cocoa is better.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:53.350
Yeah? You think so too?

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.010
Yes.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:59.190
Maki's coat today was the color of hot cocoa that's too light on flavor.

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.770
Huh?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.190
That's kind of mean!

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:06.400
There was no right answer.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.450
H-He's calling me.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.450
What is it, Hosaka-senpai?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:19.210
What do you think, Atsuko?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.290
About what?

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:24.380
Are they the same, or not the same?

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:28.100
Two possible answers to a question I have zero context on.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.050
What should I do?

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.630
Is there no right answer again?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:37.220
The same, or not the same?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.360
Maybe they're neither.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.920
You're right, in a way.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:50.460
I had this feeling that Maki's new coat
.was the same color as Minami Haruka's.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:52.990
But I guess that's not a problem after all.

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:55.740
I got it right, in a way...

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.580
It's not an uncommon shade,
.so this must happen on occasion.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:05.500
But when I saw that sweet caffè latte color,

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.170
could you blame me for
letting my instincts take over?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.960
Well...

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:13.300
What, then, can I do with my
overflowing emotions?

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.930
Uh, um...

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:16.930
Nothing!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.970
Because my emotions
have nowhere to flow!

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:22.520
Maybe there's no point
.thinking about some questions.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.940
I can't do anything!
Maybe there's no point
.thinking about some questions.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:24.150
I can't do anything!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:31.190
Love Now says that a girl's worth is determined by
.the number of guys who confess their love to her.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.070
It was the rival girl who said that, right?

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.280
And then she got dumped afterward?

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.240
Yes, but I think there's a certain logic to it.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:38.910
What about you? Are you popular with guys?

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:39.990
If there's no point in thinking,
.then I should try not thinking at all.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:43.260
No. Can you teach me how to be?

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:45.820
Hey, Atsuko-san, are you popular with guys?

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.580
What? I knew it!

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:51.760
Is there a secret to it?

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:54.200
How do you attract guys?

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:57.680
What?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.310
How do you attract guys?

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.180
Sorry. I wasn't thinking about anything.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:04.810
Hear that, Uchida?

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.980
You can be popular with guys if
.you don't think about anything.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:07.810
What?!

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.690
Is that for real, Kana?

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.190
What are you talking about?

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:16.020
Right, they call her the Witch!

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:18.820
She must have magical powers!

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.950
The magic of love?

00:09:21.220 --> 00:09:24.620
I can't believe you could say something so embarrassing with a straight face!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.120
What are you talking about?

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:30.350
Never mind that! Atsuko-sensei! Please tell me the secret!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.590
Teach me the magic of love!

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.630
What? U-Um...

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:42.620
Maybe you could wear a
royal milk tea-colored coat?

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.560
I see!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.940
Haruka!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:52.020
Do you have a royal milk tea-colored coat?

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.030
Chiaki?

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.240
Can I borrow your royal milk tea-colored coat?

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:55.740
I couldn't think of anything,
Can I borrow your royal milk tea-colored coat?

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:56.450
No.
I couldn't think of anything,

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:56.990
What? Please, Chiaki!
I couldn't think of anything,

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.030
What? Please, Chiaki!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:58.660
but maybe it worked out just fine anyway.
What? Please, Chiaki!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.490
I have no coats to lend you.
but maybe it worked out just fine anyway.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:00.910
Why not?!
but maybe it worked out just fine anyway.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:01.530
Why not?!

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.660
Why not, Chiaki?!

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:09.250
Now that I'm wearing Haruka's royal
milk tea-colored coat, guys will be all over me!

00:10:09.930 --> 00:10:10.630
Hmm?

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.940
I nearly mistook someone
.for Minami Haruka again.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.010
So even the sky laughs at me, does it?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:21.890
Did you see it?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.180
I did.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.720
Who'd have thought it'd snow so much?

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:26.730
It was beautiful.

00:10:27.290 --> 00:10:29.190
So this is what they mean by "pure white."

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.260
Yes.

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:32.570
When I opened the curtains, the world shone with silver.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.260
I was at a loss for words.

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:38.680
My little sister had already opened
.the curtains when I woke up.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.420
I was so excited.

00:10:40.420 --> 00:10:43.120
Did you jump out of the window
and feel the snow all around you?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.700
That's what my sister did.

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:49.820
If I were as young as she,
I would've done the same.

00:10:50.550 --> 00:10:53.940
I wish it had snowed more.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.460
Then I could've made an igloo.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:58.970
Igloo?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:02.720
Friends and a warm household.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:03.800
Minami Haruka!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:08.730
I hope it snows again.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.940
36.8 degrees.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.570
I guess it's a light fever.

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:22.750
<b>Infirmary
</b>

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.450
Oh, Haruka-senpai.
<b>Infirmary
</b>

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.910
Oh, Haruka-senpai.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:25.960
Hitomi.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:27.370
Are you unwell?

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.750
I was feeling tired, so I
.came to check if I had a fever.

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:32.880
But it was just a light one.

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:34.340
You too?

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:36.800
Did you come to check as well?

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:38.670
I was feeling a little tired.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:42.430
It got cold all of a sudden, so I'm
.afraid I might have caught a cold.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.300
It was snowing so much this morning, too.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.500
Yeah.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:49.140
Well, I'll leave you to it.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:49.920
Okay.

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.060
Huh?

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:55.700
Natsuki!

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.400
What are you doing in the hallway?

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:00.860
What?

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.030
You...

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.340
might want to button that up.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.620
I forgot to button up after
measuring my temperature!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:23.340
H-Hey.

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:25.640
Did you see?

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.310
Yes. Of course I did.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:35.520
How can he say that with such an innocent look in his eyes?

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.190
It was a beautiful sight.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.440
A true, pure white.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.400
Don't go and describe the color!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.820
Don't say "pure white" like that!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.720
It was already open,
so I saw right away.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:47.200
I was excited.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.910
I-I didn't do it on purpose or anything.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:52.200
Wait, e-excited?!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.750
It looked so fluffy and soft.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.790
It would have felt so nice
.to just jump right in.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.800
J-Jump right in? Here?!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.480
It was close.

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:06.800
If I were a little younger, I would've just jumped in and felt it all around me.

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.680
How old do you think you are?!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:09.930
You're the same age as me!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.810
But it's a pity.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:15.000
I just wish there had been a bit more volume.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.270
A bit more...

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.320
By the way, did you see?

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.400
Idiot!

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.320
36.5 degrees is normal, right?

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:32.330
I feel a bit tired, but I'll hang in there.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.560
Natsuki-kun!

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.170
Oh, Haruka-senpa—

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:44.800
Hey, tell me... Did you see it?

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:48.260
I did! Or rather, I can almost see...

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:50.680
It was so white!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.180
I guess you'd call it "pure white"?

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.810
I didn't see anything!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:09.570
There was so much snow,
too... Didn't he see it?

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.080
Haruka-senpai!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.540
Hitomi?

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:16.080
You look pretty upset.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.790
Of course I am!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:19.920
That damn Natsuki!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.630
What happened with Natsuki-kun?

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.760
That lowlife...

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.840
He's not getting out of this
one without a few bruises!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.300
What on Earth happened?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.350
He was staring at my breasts!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.230
He was <i>ogling</i> them!

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:38.080
Your breasts...

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:46.490
H-Hold on... did Natsuki-kun...

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:52.870
He was saying they were beautiful pure white or whatever, like an innocent child.

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.330
Pure white?!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.240
He said he was really excited and stuff.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.210
Excited?

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:03.420
Then he said they looked fluffy and soft, and he wanted to just jump right in.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.880
Jump right in?!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:09.590
Well, he said if I were younger.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.930
Does that mean I'm not young enough?

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:16.560
Then he said they would've been better if they were bigger!

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.260
He's scum!

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:20.350
Bigger?!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.080
Yes, it's true!

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:40.830
Minami Haruka is perfect.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.750
She's too perfect.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.580
She is truly...

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.090
Hosaka! Hosaka!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:48.420
Is my scarf done?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.130
This isn't the time for that!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.140
I have come face to face with the truth.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.570
The truth?

00:15:56.570 --> 00:15:57.890
What truth?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.140
Isn't it obvious?

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:02.140
The truth about Minami Haruka.

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:12.500
This is bad.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:21.620
You want to know Haruka's weaknesses?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.250
Yeah.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:26.500
I think Haruka is fine the way she is now.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.800
That won't do.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:31.050
My scarf won't get finished.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.050
What's coming up?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:36.140
You mean winter break?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.850
And what's over winter break?

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.110
Christmas.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.180
Hayami-senpai, did you get a boyfriend?

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.520
Hell no!

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.440
I'm sorry!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:53.110
Christmas. A holy night
.that comes once a year.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:56.960
What would happen if <i>he</i> was in <i>that</i> condition on such a day?

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.330
"He"?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.410
You mean Hosaka-senpai?

00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:07.240
Hosaka has yearned for Haruka-chan, all without ever really talking to her.

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:12.340
As a result, his imagination took over.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:18.350
If Christmas arrives, and he is still in such a condition, a goddess will be born within him.

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:21.400
A goddess known as Haruka-chan.

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:26.770
If this keeps up, Hosaka will
.never see the real Haruka-chan.

00:17:29.130 --> 00:17:34.740
And he'll talk about her day and night.

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.320
That sounds really painful.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.320
To stop him...

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:42.080
We have to hit him in
.the face with reality, right?

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.580
The real Minami Haruka!

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:46.040
Yeah! Hit him with reality!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.830
Bang! Boom!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.330
I'm counting on you, Maki!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.550
Roger!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.300
That's how it is, Atsuko.

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:56.380
We're going to see Kana-chan
and her family today.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.390
Um, okay...

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:02.600
And we'll find a weakness of Haruka's
.that'd turn off even Hosaka-senpai.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:10.310
I know you don't like Hosaka-senpai, but you shouldn't get in his way.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.900
I'm not getting in his way!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.740
I just want to give him a glimpse of the truth.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.900
Ideally, a glimpse that
.really turns him off Haruka.

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:21.240
Maki...

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:23.660
Haruka's weaknesses?

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:27.210
Yeah. I was just curious.

00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:29.960
Need any help with the Christmas preparations?

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.420
Yes, please.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.920
What do you two think?

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:38.340
How could such a thought cross your mind? Haruka-neesama has no weaknesses.

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:39.720
R-Right...

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.080
That reverent expression...

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:44.430
Is Haruka already a goddess in her eyes?

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:47.620
Haruka-neesama is a wonderful sister.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.440
Allow me to tell you just how wonderful she is.

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.650
Okay, Atsuko'll listen.

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:53.400
What?

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:59.030
A thousand words are not enough
.to express how wonderful she is,

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:04.120
but if you're that curious, I'll
.give you ten thousand words.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:05.950
This might take a while...

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.370
What about from your perspective?

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.940
Oh, she's got plenty of weaknesses.

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:12.760
In general, she's lazy,

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:15.210
and she has no drive without competition.

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.130
It's impossible to drag her out of the kotatsu.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:17.880
And...

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.340
Lazy.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.620
No drive.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:21.800
Can't drag her out.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.510
Hey!

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.140
What's that notepad?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.520
Is this an interview?

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:28.930
Uh, this is...

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:32.100
What are you talking about?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.730
Sounds like you're having fun.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:37.070
We were just talking about something that has nothing at all to do with you!

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.820
Nothing what-so-ever!

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:42.660
Kana is excluding me.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.120
When she was little,
she followed me everywhere,

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:49.750
shouting "Sis! Sis!" until I went
...deaf in the ears, but now...

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:50.910
Deaf in the ears?!

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:53.160
I remember it like it was yesterday.

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:56.000
Kana was in fourth grade.

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.210
She said she felt lonely and
.couldn't fall asleep by herself,

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.920
so she came into my bed, and...

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:06.260
Again?

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:08.060
Chiaki will cry if she wakes up without you.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.810
I'll go back before then.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.980
Yay!

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:27.240
Actually, I'm worried about Chiaki!

00:20:27.240 --> 00:20:28.900
Hold it, Kana!

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:30.240
Don't tell me you...

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.500
No, I didn't!

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.330
No! Anything but that story!

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:39.880
Kana, how could you do that to Haruka-neesama's bed?

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.100
No!

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.970
I really was worried about you! That's why I wanted to go back!

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.280
And... Oh, I remember!

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.740
Stop!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:51.260
We came to find a fact about Haruka that'd turn someone off.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:55.150
But all we got were facts about
.Kana-chan that'd turn anyone off.

00:20:56.430 --> 00:20:57.620
Hey, Atsuko.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:21:01.440
Do you think maybe people who say bad things about Haruka get struck by divine punishment?

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.740
There, there.

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:09.950
So? Were you two able to find out any of Haruka-chan's weaknesses?

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.660
Haruka has no weaknesses.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.420
Huh? None?

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:17.960
None.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:18.840
None at all?

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.420
None at all.

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.840
There has to be something...

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.220
She's perfect.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.470
No way... Impossible...

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.810
At this rate, nothing stands between Haruka-chan and divinity!

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:34.980
Listen, Minami Haruka...

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:37.980
Listen to my feelings.

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:36.940
Thanks, Fujioka.

00:22:36.940 --> 00:22:38.960
Thanks for being
.Santa for Chiaki.

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:42.200
Sure! You can count on me!

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:51.280
My feelings for you can't be expressed with a simple "I love you."

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:54.130
I couldn't find the words
.to describe this feeling.

00:22:55.170 --> 00:22:57.510
But tonight, on this night...

00:22:58.190 --> 00:23:01.290
I have found those words at last.

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:03.930
Unconditional love.

00:23:03.930 --> 00:23:05.810
Unlimited love.

00:23:05.810 --> 00:23:08.040
A love exceeding that of mortals.

00:23:08.040 --> 00:23:09.240
In other words,

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:12.410
Minami Haruka, to me...

00:23:12.730 --> 00:23:13.660
You are...

00:23:17.150 --> 00:23:18.630
A goddess!

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:23.920
Keiko-chan, what did you get from Santa?

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:26.100
What? Um...

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:30.120
Next episode: "Start Planning Your Year
From New Year's Day."

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:31.960
An electronic dictionary, I guess.

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:33.980
I knew you'd get that!
